    {
      "id": "hGX8Xnd6OBNZfT3WyUdSe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9963.360281669658,
      "y": 2237.403628877597,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "-26gdd7UPUPmXGdmc81TM",
        "zUxwPtJaS5pjdiIpzXXGX",
        "eamBe1A_1rK3Pr8LdKAQ4",
        "jcw8AbsFPPGYvojo2OFDZ",
        "TytRVEgR0MwsShUl5bLpF",
        "yDg-UbgD5kmsFMUCTmv8e",
        "UqrTxGW-ffXaNzZeQ8JRa",
        "OK-K0oLKxe3y-UFivB4ck"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1542324367,
      "version": 8734,
      "versionNonce": 1475001263,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791873362271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prompt chaining decomposes a task into a sequence of steps, where each LLM call processes the output\nof the previous one. You can add programmatic checks (see \"gate” in the diagram below) on any\nintermediate steps to ensure that the process is still on track.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis workflow is ideal for situations where the task can be easily and cleanly decomposed into fixed\nsubtasks. The main goal is to trade off latency for higher accuracy, by making each LLM call an easier\ntask.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prompt chaining decomposes a task into a sequence of steps, where each LLM call processes the output of the previous one. You can add programmatic checks (see \"gate” in the diagram below) on any intermediate steps to ensure that the process is still on track.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis workflow is ideal for situations where the task can be easily and cleanly decomposed into fixed subtasks. The main goal is to trade off latency for higher accuracy, by making each LLM call an easier task.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1791802801645,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
