    {
      "id": "LgagqyH4IP2uSednacPJa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9940.60028263287,
      "y": 3320.163459679312,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "7XUQocBgGRori4h1iSXUU",
        "NcYWYPFx8G7sraVk-Y-eq",
        "9UBHU6B6rnZiZwZGq_Uau",
        "zqsfiFvn2AQgwqoFsNPkE",
        "HmB0-S3qqakXMpo1iPV1e",
        "DWLD6LsEd1COg7HqT3WB8",
        "nSxbRTsXyV3lNs-YqnlyR",
        "yd-bglvCf5uxIyCXPIPFz"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 864946511,
      "version": 8861,
      "versionNonce": 23168527,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791873362271,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LLMs can sometimes work simultaneously on a task and have their outputs aggregated programmatically.\nThis workflow, parallelization, manifests in two key variations:\n\n    - Sectioning: Breaking a task into independent subtasks run in parallel.\n    - Voting: Running the same task multiple times to get diverse outputs.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nParallelization is effective when the divided subtasks can be parallelized for speed, or when multiple\nperspectives or attempts are needed for higher confidence results",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LLMs can sometimes work simultaneously on a task and have their outputs aggregated programmatically. This workflow, parallelization, manifests in two key variations:\n\n    - Sectioning: Breaking a task into independent subtasks run in parallel.\n    - Voting: Running the same task multiple times to get diverse outputs.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nParallelization is effective when the divided subtasks can be parallelized for speed, or when multiple perspectives or attempts are needed for higher confidence results",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1791802801645,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
